            "title": "Analysis-Innovent's weight-loss drug highlights China challenge for Novo, Lilly",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "SHANGHAI (Reuters) -Innovent Biologics' newly launched weight-loss drug is making inroads in its home market of China, ramping up competition with its Western rivals as it pursues a marketing strategy that is gaining traction.  Xinermei, launched in July, is the third once-weekly injectable GLP-1 weight management\u00a0therapy available in China after Novo Nordisk's Wegovy and Eli Lilly's Mounjaro.  Those were introduced in late 2024 and January 2025 respectively,\u00a0several months after their own approvals, into a Chinese weight-loss drug market that is expected by analysts to be worth billions in the coming years.",
